        <item>
            <title>0.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 22:22:30 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.2.1</h2>
<p>New for BitTorrent tasks:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Inspector tabs: Overview, Trackers, Peers and Files.</li>
  <li>Trackers: See each tracker's status. Add, remove or edit trackers, and reannounce whenever you like.</li>
  <li>Peers: See who you're connected to and how fast each peer is.</li>
  <li>New commands in the right-click menu: Reannounce, Force Recheck and Super Seeding.</li>
  <li>Files: Choosing which files to download now has its own tab.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.2.1 (简体中文)</h2>
<p>BT 下载新增：</p>
<ul>
  <li>检查器标签页：概览、Tracker、节点、文件。</li>
  <li>Tracker：查看每个 Tracker 的状态、上次结果和下次汇报时间；可以添加、删除、编辑，随时重新汇报。</li>
  <li>节点：查看现在连着谁、各自多快。</li>
  <li>右键菜单新增：重新汇报、强制重新校验、超级做种。</li>
  <li>文件：选择要下载的文件现在单独一页。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
